-- search-help.txt --
AIGW  aigw model search
────────────────────────────────────────
  Search what providers offer, from their authenticated catalogs.
  Each model is added, available, missing (added, but no longer listed) or deprecated. A catalog does not say which client can use a model.

Usage
  aigw model search [query] [flags]

Examples
  aigw model search
  aigw model search sonnet --provider dmxapi --provider ucloud
  aigw model search gpt 6.1 --json

Options
  -h, --help               help for search
      --json               Write the models as JSON
      --provider strings   Only this provider's catalog; repeatable
